</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e8d8db6c-8613-11f1-b825-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-22T025205Z-1253202588-RC2QIMAV9OHC-RTRMADP-3-ASEAN-PHILIPPINES.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e8d8db6c-8613-11f1-b825-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-22T025205Z-1253202588-RC2QIMAV9OHC-RTRMADP-3-ASEAN-PHILIPPINES.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ede223a2-8613-11f1-8197-b96b7307d1da</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:25:57 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e8d8db6c-8613-11f1-b825-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-22T025205Z-1253202588-RC2QIMAV9OHC-RTRMADP-3-ASEAN-PHILIPPINES.jpg">via REUTERS - Brendan Smialowski</source><dc:creator>安娜</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>危机中的德国汽车制造商——中国已不再是销售市场</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260722-%E5%8D%B1%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E5%95%86-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%B7%B2%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E6%98%AF%E9%94%80%E5%94%AE%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA</link><description>
