</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4260890-36a8-11f1-aee5-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-04-08T090347Z-1393374881-RC231IAVUUQ3-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ECONOMY-INDUSTRIALORDERS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4260890-36a8-11f1-aee5-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-04-08T090347Z-1393374881-RC231IAVUUQ3-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ECONOMY-INDUSTRIALORDERS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d76455e2-8612-11f1-ba0b-b96b7307d1da</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:18:19 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c4260890-36a8-11f1-aee5-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-04-08T090347Z-1393374881-RC231IAVUUQ3-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ECONOMY-INDUSTRIALORDERS.jpg">REUTERS - Annegret Hilse</source><dc:creator>柏林特约记者 丹兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>特朗普扬言伊朗若再袭霍尔木兹海峡船只 美将炸桥梁或发电厂</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260722-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%89%AC%E8%A8%80%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E8%8B%A5%E5%86%8D%E8%A2%AD%E9%9C%8D%E5%B0%94%E6%9C%A8%E5%85%B9%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1%E8%88%B9%E5%8F%AA-%E7%BE%8E%E5%B0%86%E7%82%B8%E6%A1%A5%E6%A2%81%E6%88%96%E5%8F%91%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%82</link><description>
